AmiBinkD v10.32 - SpitfireTN Ent.
-=====================================-
Native AmigaOS FTN mailer, binkd port.
No ixemul/ixnet -- talks straight to
bsdsocket.library. BinkP protocol with
CRAM-MD5 auth, for any Amiga BBS. Log
reads clean at the default level -- no
masks to tune, no duplicate lines.
-=====================================-
